    "body": "Thanks for the images, but I'm having a hard time understanding the behavior difference. The change is released in chrome canary with experimental web platform features enabled: chrome://flags/#enable-experimental-web-platform-features\r\n\r\nDo you think you could test it out and share a video? Or give a list of steps I can read to repro the change in behavior?",
