    "created_at": "2026-03-05T11:49:08Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-05T11:49:08Z",
    "body": "I'm still trying to understand why we need most of these changes. Couldn't we rely on https://github.com/w3c/uievents/pull/413 for the backdrop case and handling down should check that event's .buttons is 1. (that .buttons==1 check is basically what one gets from using click in pointer events spec) ",
