    "created_at": "2026-06-01T18:09:49Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-06-01T18:09:49Z",
    "body": "I know we decided to wait for the UIEvents spec to be updated, but I'd rather not make users keep waiting for light dismiss to work properly on touch devices among other things for over a year after I actually wrote a fix for it.\r\n\r\nIf nobody has more feedback about this approach, I am going to try shipping this change in chromium.",
